N:For me this has the feel of a Swedish gånglat. I hadn't intended it to, but it insisted.
N: It's about Sitting In The Stern Of the Kirkwall to Aberdeen ferry on a cloudless midnight
N: at the end of May, seeing the semicircle of sunset colours recede as we go south.
